      "description": "Řádek tiskopisu v archu dne; vyrovnaný podíl přeškrtnutý vlasovou linkou tiskové modři.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-list\"><button class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-row-text\"><span class=\"ds-row-title\">Nákup Albert</span><span class=\"ds-row-meta\">Platil Petr · 4 lidi</span></span><span class=\"ds-row-amt\"><span class=\"ds-mono\">1 240 Kč</span><span class=\"ds-share ds-settled\">Tvůj podíl 310 Kč</span></span></button></div>",
      "css": ":host{--color-paper:#f3f6f8;--color-sheet:#fff;--color-ink:#15181c;--color-ink-2:#4b5569;--color-ink-3:#6f7a8e;--color-rule:#c9d3e8;--color-rule-soft:#e3e8f3;--color-form:#1f3a93;--color-form-ink:#fff;--color-form-soft:#e5eaf6;--color-form-deep:#172c70;--color-owe:#a8321f;--color-owe-soft:#f8e9e6;}.ds-list{overflow:hidden;background:var(--color-sheet);border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--color-rule);}.ds-row{font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;width:100%;min-height:64px;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule-soft);background:transparent;text-align:left;color:var(--color-ink);cursor:pointer;}.ds-row:active{background:var(--color-paper);}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-form, #1f3a93);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-icon{display:flex;width:40px;height:40px;flex-shrink:0;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid var(--color-rule);border-radius:4px;color:var(--color-form);box-sizing:border-box;}.ds-row-text{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;}.ds-row-title{font-weight:500;}.ds-row-meta{font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-ink-3);}.ds-row-amt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;}.ds-mono{font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:500;}.ds-share{font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-ink);}.ds-settled{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:var(--color-form);text-decoration-thickness:1px;}"
    },
