      "description": "Lepkavá lišta na papíře: přepínač party vlevo, nastavení a profil vpravo.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-nav\"><button class=\"ds-nav-switch\"><span class=\"ds-nav-emoji\">🏕️</span><span class=\"ds-nav-name\">Chata Krkonoše</span></button><button class=\"ds-nav-icon\" aria-label=\"Nastavení\"><svg width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></button><span class=\"ds-nav-av\">P</span></header>",
      "css": ":host{--color-paper:#f3f6f8;--color-sheet:#fff;--color-ink:#15181c;--color-ink-2:#4b5569;--color-ink-3:#6f7a8e;--color-rule:#c9d3e8;--color-rule-soft:#e3e8f3;--color-form:#1f3a93;--color-form-ink:#fff;--color-form-soft:#e5eaf6;--color-form-deep:#172c70;--color-owe:#a8321f;--color-owe-soft:#f8e9e6;}.ds-nav{font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;height:56px;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:0 16px;background:rgb(243 246 248 / 0.95);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(201 211 232 / 0.7);}.ds-nav-switch{font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;flex:1;min-width:0;height:44px;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 8px;margin-left:-8px;border:none;background:transparent;border-radius:6px;color:var(--color-ink);cursor:pointer;}.ds-nav-switch:active{background:var(--color-rule-soft);}.ds-nav-emoji{display:flex;width:32px;height:32px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid var(--color-rule);border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-sheet);font-size:1.125rem;}.ds-nav-name{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}.ds-nav-icon{display:flex;width:44px;height:44px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:none;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink-2);cursor:pointer;}.ds-nav-icon:active{background:var(--color-rule-soft);}.ds-nav-switch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-form, #1f3a93);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-nav-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-form, #1f3a93);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-nav-av{display:inline-flex;width:30px;height:30px;margin:0 7px;border-radius:9999px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#5A5AF2;color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:12.6px;}"
